{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"觀塘男子遇襲受傷送院\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/WOUND-KT-261113-06.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】一名男子凌晨在觀塘被人用刀襲擊受傷送院。</p><p>現場是輔仁街8號對開，警員圍封一段行人路搜證，地上遺下一件染血外套。</p><p>警方凌晨一時許接報，一名男子懷疑被人持利刀襲擊，兇徒施襲後逃去，遇襲男子手部受傷昏迷倒臥地上，由救護車送院後回復清醒，暫時無人被捕。</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T00:04:23.262987+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":130,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T23:25:10+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T00:32:49.729039+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T23:57:48.414104+00:00","content_hash":"02f39681bc1ae813f09208f890644a123240c80f32ce7122d773375c81bd1d3e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}